(B-axis vector dry run for head-head probing)
(No probing. No WCS changes. No contact moves.)
(Start from a safe open-air position clear of the sphere, table, and fixtures.)
(Sequence: B0 C0, B+15 C0, B-15 C0, B+30 C0, B-30 C0, B0 C0)
(The program returns to the starting XYZ before each vector check.)

(Does not issue G49; leave active tool-length state unchanged.)
G21 G17 G40 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

#<vector_step> = 3.0
#<linear_fr> = 150.0
#<rotary_fr> = 200.0

#100 = #<_x>
#101 = #<_y>
#102 = #<_z>
#103 = #<vector_step>
#104 = #<linear_fr>
#105 = #<rotary_fr>

o<b_vector_pose> sub
  #<b_pose> = #1
  #<c_pose> = #2

  G90
  F#104
  G1 X#100 Y#101 Z#102
  F#105
  G1 B#<b_pose> C#<c_pose>

  (W points along the probe vector toward the table at this B/C pose.)
  #<w_x> = [SIN[#<b_pose>] * COS[#<c_pose>]]
  #<w_y> = [SIN[#<b_pose>] * SIN[#<c_pose>]]
  #<w_z> = [-COS[#<b_pose>]]

  (U is perpendicular to W in the tilt plane.)
  #<u_x> = [COS[#<b_pose>] * COS[#<c_pose>]]
  #<u_y> = [COS[#<b_pose>] * SIN[#<c_pose>]]
  #<u_z> = [SIN[#<b_pose>]]

  (V is perpendicular to W and U; at C0 this is machine +Y.)
  #<v_x> = [-SIN[#<c_pose>]]
  #<v_y> = [COS[#<c_pose>]]
  #<v_z> = 0.0

  (DEBUG, B_VECTOR_DRY_RUN pose_b=#<b_pose> pose_c=#<c_pose>)
  (DEBUG, W=#<w_x>,#<w_y>,#<w_z> U=#<u_x>,#<u_y>,#<u_z> V=#<v_x>,#<v_y>,#<v_z>)

  G91
  F#104

  (Move away from the probe vector, then return.)
  G1 X[-#<w_x> * #103] Y[-#<w_y> * #103] Z[-#<w_z> * #103]
  G1 X[#<w_x> * #103] Y[#<w_y> * #103] Z[#<w_z> * #103]

  (Move in +U, then return.)
  G1 X[#<u_x> * #103] Y[#<u_y> * #103] Z[#<u_z> * #103]
  G1 X[-#<u_x> * #103] Y[-#<u_y> * #103] Z[-#<u_z> * #103]

  (Move in +V, then return.)
  G1 X[#<v_x> * #103] Y[#<v_y> * #103] Z[#<v_z> * #103]
  G1 X[-#<v_x> * #103] Y[-#<v_y> * #103] Z[-#<v_z> * #103]

  G90
o<b_vector_pose> endsub

(Run conservative B-only vector checks at C0.)
o<b_vector_pose> call [0.0] [0.0]
o<b_vector_pose> call [15.0] [0.0]
o<b_vector_pose> call [-15.0] [0.0]
o<b_vector_pose> call [30.0] [0.0]
o<b_vector_pose> call [-30.0] [0.0]
o<b_vector_pose> call [0.0] [0.0]

G90
F#104
G1 X#100 Y#101 Z#102
F#105
G1 B0 C0

(DEBUG, B_VECTOR_DRY_RUN complete)
M2
